{"id":"vod_bf_15746","vodId":"15746","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"家庭教师","name_cn":"家庭教师","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-16/a6f560f55ba53aeea55e550fc7c7db35.jpg"},"summary":"长得像婴儿一样可爱的里包恩（西萩五十铃 配音），真实身份其实是令人闻风丧胆的意大利黑手党杀手。他奉彭格列的第九代老大的命令，来到日本寻找彭格列的第十代老大沢田纲吉（国分优香里 配音），并把他培养成合格的接班人。 沢田纲吉外号废柴纲，就读于并盛中学一年A班，全科成绩平均17.5分，跳马只能跳三层，单杠向上翻转也不会，无论做什么事都不行的废柴。里包恩行为搞怪过激，让一向邋遢不求上进的纲头疼不已。但是里包恩通过必死弹，竟然让并盛中学的偶像笹川京子（稲村优奈 配音）对一直默默无闻的纲产生了好感。纲慢慢开始接受里包恩的改造，过起了欢乐和恐怖的生活，并向黑手党首领一步步迈进。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:21:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":203,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/jiatingjiaoshi/第14集/index.m3u8"}